WEBVTT

00:34:27.060 --> 00:34:30.136
and wanting you to tell your whole story
right there on the spot.

00:34:30.160 --> 00:34:32.706
And that was a horrible experience for me.

00:34:32.730 --> 00:34:38.238
And what happened was I left
the debriefing angry, upset.

00:34:39.177 --> 00:34:42.107
AG: This old support model
brought in professional counselors,

00:34:42.131 --> 00:34:46.626
who often lacked personal experience
with what first responders went through.

00:34:46.650 --> 00:34:49.943
Research suggested analyzing
the incident right away with a counselor

00:34:49.967 --> 00:34:52.576
often doesn't help and can backfire.

00:34:52.600 --> 00:34:54.743
What people actually need
is emotional support

00:34:54.767 --> 00:34:57.711
from someone who can empathize
with their experience,

00:34:57.735 --> 00:35:01.543
especially since there's often a stigma
associated with asking for help.